Now I see the key issue. In the `BLOSC_SHUFFLE` case:

```c
for (int j = 0; j <= filters_meta[i]; j++) {
    shuffle(typesize, bsize, _src, _dest);
    // Cycle filters when required
    if (j < filters_meta[i]) {
      _src = _dest;
      _dest = _tmp;
      _tmp = _src;
    }
}
```

The buffers cycle between `_src`, `_dest`, and `_tmp`. Initially `_src = src + offset`, `_dest = dest`, `_tmp = tmp`.

